TinyVDB I/O (tinyvdb_io.h) — vendored into lightusd
==============================================

Source: https://github.com/syoyo/tinyvdbio
License: Apache License 2.0

Local integration changes are limited to repointing miniz, LZ4, and zstd
includes at lightusd's existing vendored copies. `src/usdVol.cc` owns the
renderer-facing dense conversion and memory budget rather than modifying the
upstream sparse-tree representation.
